      "value": "Yeah but this would not be like a group per-say like thing they have now, I do use that for members of my discord server but I was thinking of a temp way to get everyone moved to a new location, I guess you could use \"groups\" but then you would be removing people or deleting the group  but I was thinking it would be easier to create a friends list open their bio click add to the list and then you could send invites easier maybe I am just over thinking this lol",
