  "details": "I think it would be cool to make a temp friends group list so if you are hanging out with people in one world and you decide to go some where else and you can't drop a portal, it would be convenient to click on a person and hit add to group so that you can just add everyone who wants to go in this group and when you get there you just hit invite group and everyone gets an invite to the new world instead of having to either be on green or scan through your friends list hoping you remember everyone",
